# Party banter in Castle Ravenloft's high tower and spires. Each node opens with an `if` gate: the node is eligible
# only while its condition holds. Party members speak only through interjections.

~ banter_well
if at:castle_ravenloft_spires and not flag.heart_of_sorrow_known and name:kip_smudgewick and name:wren_featherfoot
interject name:kip_smudgewick: No rail. Five hundred feet of stairs and not one rail. Whoever built this has never once been taken to court.
interject name:wren_featherfoot: Wall side, Kip. Hand on the stone, eyes on my heels. Not the drop. My heels are much nicer.
endif
-> END

~ banter_heart_known
if flag.heart_of_sorrow_known and not flag.heart_of_sorrow_shattered and name:ratatoille and name:godrick_pendlebrook
interject name:ratatoille: A heart of glass that takes his wounds for him. Not his soul, only his pain. It's almost elegant.
interject name:godrick_pendlebrook: Right. So we break the heart. Then we hit him. Then it hurts. Is that it?
interject name:ratatoille: That's... yes. That is exactly it.
endif
-> END

~ banter_heart_broken
if flag.heart_of_sorrow_shattered and not flag.strahd_heart_tested
interject tag:blunt: He'll have felt that. Wherever he is, he felt that.
interject tag:cynical: Good. Let him feel something, for once. It'll be new for him.
endif
-> END

~ banter_after_test
if flag.strahd_heart_tested and name:liriel_dawnsong and name:godrick_pendlebrook
interject name:liriel_dawnsong: He came up the well himself. Not his wolves. Not his brides. We have hurt him, and he knows it.
interject name:godrick_pendlebrook: He looked sad, though. Not hurt. Sad. Like we'd broken the last thing he had.
endif
-> END

~ banter_pidlwick
if guest:pidlwick_ii and not flag.pidlwick_truth_known and name:thistle and name:ratatoille
interject tag:cheerful: I like him. He's the only thing in this castle that's pleased to see us.
interject name:thistle: He doesn't smell of anything. Not happy, not scared. Nothing.
interject name:ratatoille: He's clockwork, Thistle. Clockwork doesn't smell.
interject name:thistle: Everything smells.
endif
-> END

~ banter_pidlwick_truth
if guest:pidlwick_ii and flag.pidlwick_truth_known and name:wren_featherfoot and name:liriel_dawnsong
interject name:wren_featherfoot: Funny how Pidlwick always ends up behind me on the stairs. I've started going down them backwards.
interject name:liriel_dawnsong: He has kept every promise he's made us. I'm watching him too, Wren. Kindly, and with both eyes.
endif
-> END

~ banter_escher
if flag.escher_met and not flag.escher_fight_won and name:wren_featherfoot and name:godrick_pendlebrook
interject name:wren_featherfoot: A hundred years locked in with all those coats. I'd have tried every one on by the first Tuesday.
interject name:godrick_pendlebrook: That's a long time to be dressed for nowhere.
endif
-> END

~ banter_escher_bargain
if flag.escher_bargain and name:liriel_dawnsong and name:kip_smudgewick
interject name:liriel_dawnsong: We promised that poor creature his door, and I mean to keep it. I want it said that I noticed, all the same.
interject name:kip_smudgewick: Next time, could we get it in writing? For my nerves, Miss Liriel. Not for his.
endif
-> END

~ banter_ravens
if flag.roost_swarm_cleared and name:thistle and name:wren_featherfoot
interject name:thistle: Ravens remember. Every raven in the valley will know about that roost by dark.
interject name:wren_featherfoot: Lovely. We've upset the one bird that holds a grudge.
interject name:thistle: Crows hold them too. Grandda's crow sulked at me a whole winter.
endif
-> END

~ banter_roofs
if at:castle_ravenloft_spires_roofs and name:thistle and name:kip_smudgewick
interject species:dwarf: Stone under my feet I trust. Stone with sky on both sides of it, less so.
interject name:thistle: Best bit of the whole castle! Sky, wind, and no walls!
interject name:kip_smudgewick: I looked down. Don't look down. I sell ladders, and I have never wanted one more.
endif
-> END
